      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Systems using the deliberative architecture follow a sense-plan-act cycle.


    Firstly
    the system will observe its environment and gather information, it will then
    use that data to produce a plan of action according to what it has seen and with
    the context of its existing knowledge base. Finally it will put its plan into
    action.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bbdd15ae4960c0f43b5c88a7a811a333, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 5462096026412126575, guid: bbdd15ae4960c0f43b5c88a7a811a333, type: 2}
